ShortDescription: A GPU-accelerated terminal emulator with the kitty graphics and keyboard protocols.
Description: |-
  grimalkin is a GPU-accelerated terminal emulator written in Rust. It runs on
  Windows 10/11 through ConPTY (a matching ConPTY is bundled) and supports the
  kitty graphics protocol, the kitty keyboard protocol, themes with live reload
  and WinAMP-style skins.
